msgid "I FOUND IT!"
msgstr "AURKITU DUT!"

msgid ""
"If KDE Connect is having trouble discovering other devices, you can try a "
"combination of the following solutions:\n"
"\n"
"1. \"Refresh Discovery\" through the %@ menu or pull to refresh the Devices "
"list, on this and the other devices.\n"
"\n"
"2. Make sure the other devices are also running KDE Connect and are "
"connected to the same network as this device.\n"
"\n"
"3. Manually add the other devices through the \"Configure Devices By IP\" "
"option in the %@ menu, and then \"Refresh Discovery.\"\n"
"\n"
"4. Check other solutions on the User Manual, such as configuring the "
"firewalls of the other devices:\n"
msgstr ""
"KDE Connectek beste gailuak aurkitzeko arazoak baditu, ondoko "
"konponbideetako batzuk batera proba ditzakezu:\n"
"\n"
"1. Gailu honetan eta besteetan, %@ menuan «Gailuen bilaketa freskatu» "
"hautatu, edo Gailuak zerrendatik behera tira egin hura freskatzeko.\n"
"\n"
"2. Beste gailuetan ere KDE Connect martxan dagoela eta gailu honen sare "
"berera konektatuta daudela ziurtatu.\n"
"\n"
"3. %@ menuko «Gailuak IP bidez konfiguratu» aukeraren bidez beste gailuak "
"eskuz gehitu, eta ondoren «Gailuen bilaketa freskatu» hautatu.\n"
"\n"
"4. Erabiltzailearen eskuliburuan beste konponbide batzuk kontsultatu, hala "
"nola beste gailuetako suhesiak konfiguratzea:\n"

msgid ""
"If a remembered device is already online but not shown here, try Refresh "
"Discovery."
msgstr ""
"Gordetako gailu bat dagoeneko lerroan badago baina hemen agertzen ez bada, "
"«Gailuen bilaketa freskatu» aukera probatu."

msgid ""
"If there are phantom devices or something just doesn't behave correctly, "
"erasing all saved devices data might fix it. Requires the app to be fully "
"restarted."
msgstr ""
"Mamu-gailuak badaude edo zerbait behar bezala ez badabil, gordetako gailuen "
"datu guztiak ezabatzeak arazoa konpon lezake. Aplikazioa erabat berrabiarazi "
"behar da."

